@1 = ~Safana, darling! How I've missed you.~
@2 = ~I promised you this isn't over. I have changed my mind about you however. I won't sell you back to your father in Calimport. I will sell you to slave traders instead. May your daddy stay heartbroken, whilst you'll never be found.~
@3 = ~You again! I hoped you're gone for good.~
@4 = ~Do your worst.~
@5 = ~Safana isn't with you, I see. I shall find her, once I am done with you!~
